paragraph\" >A curse has placed Radu Castle in peril. Discover and explore every corner of this vast Romanian castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/d93e0e5244f891830a3e4c538a9c777c.poster.avif?t=1787072434\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/d93e0e5244f891830a3e4c538a9c777c.webm?t=1787072434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/d93e0e5244f891830a3e4c538a9c777c.mp4?t=1787072434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/2afeafd6ea084f322e7139253f3911d0.avif?t=1787072434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras_big/2afeafd6ea084f322e7139253f3911d0.avif?t=1787072434 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters demand different tactics to hide against. Wood burns. Metal breaks. What else is there to discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/02c552e4d5614473a8a4a9d48d83ad5e.poster.avif?t=1787072434\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/02c552e4d5614473a8a4a9d48d83ad5e.webm?t=1787072434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/02c552e4d5614473a8a4a9d48d83ad5e.mp4?t=1787072434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/c24df6742032e71ec4812485dbfd9b44.avif?t=1787072434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras_big/c24df6742032e71ec4812485dbfd9b44.avif?t=1787072434 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desperate plea has caused you to return to Radu castle. Face your abuser's hellish wrath. Immerse yourself in a deep story of trauma and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/a222a6af698c3c7443399771ffe5fa58.poster.avif?t=1787072434\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/a222a6af698c3c7443399771ffe5fa58.webm?t=1787072434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/a222a6af698c3c7443399771ffe5fa58.mp4?t=1787072434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/4dda8e15b10f48de0e5d635770375b3a.avif?t=1787072434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras_big/4dda8e15b10f48de0e5d635770375b3a.avif?t=1787072434 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the stalking and hiding, test your wits with light puzzling. Uncover secrets and work yourself out of difficult situations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882610/extras/34b9424aef5b0d03173f02e9f3a35a2